flowchart LR
    A[Source train: 12,742 images] --> B[Frozen YOLOv8-s backbone feat1]
    B --> C[128 channel means + 128 standard deviations]
    C --> D[Train-only StandardScaler]
    D --> E[K-means++: K=2..8, 5 seeds]
    E --> F[Structure metrics and resampling stability]
    F --> G[Confirmed K=2; fixed centres and IDs]
    V[Source validation: 1,592 images] --> W[Same extractor, train scaler and centres]
    G --> W
    G --> H[Domain-aware detector training]
    A --> H
    H --> I[Best EMA detector: minimum source-val detection loss]
    V --> I
    I --> J[Seven-domain test: standard class confidence]
    T[Target test images: evaluation only] --> J
